    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Lustful Apocalypse</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Wyn, a demonic sorceress who has been asleep for a thousand years. She awakens in a post-apocalyptic world, only to find that her power has been stolen and scattered into crystals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endure and reclaim your strength by hunting monsters and collecting demon crystals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you enjoyed the experience as much as we enjoyed creating it!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314240/extras/5d14bf8ebfd37caaf60254c890a886c5.avif?t=1750424795\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Visit Multiple Locations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locations available in Early Access include: Subway, The Wasteland and Ruins. Each have unique monsters attached such as Wolves, Orges and Bugs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight &amp; Breed with Monsters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight Wolves, Orges and Insects or even breed with them to create your army.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join Factions, Complete Quests</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can currently join the Orge Faction which will tie into later game updates. Questing is also\u00a0 available for the player to gain power.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Subway, Collect Crystals and Power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this current build, you can explore the subway in 'Explore Mode'. Collect Crystals and Fight Wolves, even join the Orge Faction!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summon Objects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only Dragon Dildo available currently, which you can summon if you have enough power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Lustful Apocalypse</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Wyn, a demonic sorceress who has been asleep for a thousand years. She awakens in a post-apocalyptic world, only to find that her power has been stolen and scattered into crystals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endure and reclaim your strength by hunting monsters and collecting demon crystals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you enjoyed the experience as much as we enjoyed creating it!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314240/extras/5d14bf8ebfd37caaf60254c890a886c5.avif?t=1750424795\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Visit Multiple Locations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locations available in Early Access include: Subway, The Wasteland and Ruins. Each have unique monsters attached such as Wolves, Orges and Bugs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight &amp; Breed with Monsters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight Wolves, Orges and Insects or even breed with them to create your army.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join Factions, Complete Quests</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can currently join the Orge Faction which will tie into later game updates. Questing is also\u00a0 available for the player to gain power.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Subway, Collect Crystals and Power</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this current build, you can explore the subway in 'Explore Mode'. Collect Crystals and Fight Wolves, even join the Orge Faction!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summon Objects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only Dragon Dildo available currently, which you can summon if you have enough power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
